    "body": "Related to ushahidi/platform#1774 \r\n\r\n### Expected behaviour\r\nWhen location is regarded as PII in a deployment, map coordinates for the post should be obfuscated when provided from the API, so that no one can retrieve the exact locations.\r\n\r\nThis may be a randomisation within or an assignation to the centroid of a reasonably big geoblock (e.g. in function of the maximum allowed zoom level setting as specified in #1774)\r\n\r\n### Actual behaviour\r\nCurrently the API provides the exact coordinates as stored along with the post.\r\n",
